      "reviewed": true,
      "translation": "Vigor, forgiveness, fortitude, purity, absence of hatred, and absence of excessive pride—these belong to one born with the divine wealth, O Bhārata. These twenty-six qualities are the sattvic endowments suited to one oriented toward future welfare.",
